{"seq":3,"slug":"refund-amount-tax-separate","title":"退款金额与税费分离（交 62）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/refund-intelligent-routing/partial-refund/refund-amount-tax-separate","wordCount":3082,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"退款金额与税费分离-交-62\">退款金额与税费分离（交 62）</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>退款引擎最终交付的不能只是一个「退多少钱」的数字，而必须是一个<strong>带成分的结构化金额</strong>：这笔退款里有多少是商品不含税净额、多少是当初收的税、多少是运费及其税、以及优惠分摊后实际应退的部分是多少。理由很直接——下游至少有三类消费者对金额的口径要求不同：资金通道只认退款总额并把钱退出去；发票与税务系统只认净额与税额这两个独立口径；财务账务要按成分分别冲减收入、销项税与应收账款。如果引擎只交出总额，这三个消费者就各自去反推，反推的口径一旦不一致，月末必然对不上账。</p>\n<p>本 hub 与税务 hub 的分界必须在开头就划清，否则两篇会写成重复内容。<strong>本 hub 负责的是「把退款金额算清、拆开、并以正确的结构交给下游」这件事</strong>：拆分算法在部分退款与组合支付场景下如何落位、取整规则如何统一、行维度的分摊如何与税务行对应、以及拆分结果如何进入退款计划的字段契约。<strong>税务 hub 负责的是「这笔税在退款之后如何被冲减、退抵或返还，以及用什么凭证据以申报」</strong>：含税价反推净额的公式、各税制的展示差异、多税种混合的逐层拆分、申报表的行级要求、以及凭证与跨税期的调整。两篇共用的数学是税基与税率的换算，但方向与落点不同：本篇的关键词是<strong>金额口径的一致性与契约</strong>，那篇的关键词是<strong>税务后果与凭证</strong>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;退款引擎&lt;br/&gt;拆分与口径&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;资金通道&lt;br/&gt;只消费 refund_gross&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;发票与税务系统&lt;br/&gt;消费 net/tax/shipping&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; D[&quot;财务账务&lt;br/&gt;按成分分别冲减&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; E[&quot;红冲凭证/申报&lt;br/&gt;(税务 hub)&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; F[退款计划字段&lt;br/&gt;tax_parts[]&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; B&#10;    F --&gt; C&#10;    F --&gt; D\">graph TD\n    A[\"退款引擎&lt;br/&gt;拆分与口径\"] --&gt; B[\"资金通道&lt;br/&gt;只消费 refund_gross\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"发票与税务系统&lt;br/&gt;消费 net/tax/shipping\"]\n    A --&gt; D[\"财务账务&lt;br/&gt;按成分分别冲减\"]\n    C --&gt; E[\"红冲凭证/申报&lt;br/&gt;(税务 hub)\"]\n    A --&gt; F[退款计划字段&lt;br/&gt;tax_parts[]\"]\n    F --&gt; B\n    F --&gt; C\n    F --&gt; D</pre><h2 id=\"退款计划的税额字段契约\">退款计划的税额字段契约</h2><p>把税额分离做成<strong>退款计划的一部分</strong>，而不是在执行阶段现算，是本 hub 的核心设计主张。理由有三：一是拆分需要订单的行级与税率快照，这些数据在决策阶段最完整；二是执行的每一次尝试、每一次换道都必须携带同一份拆分，现算会因汇率或规则变化产生不一致；三是对账需要一个稳定的本地侧可比对物。</p>\n<p>字段契约的最小集合如下，所有金额均为最小货币单位的整数：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>字段</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>消费者</th>\n<th>是否可为零</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>refund_gross_minor</code></td>\n<td>本次退款含税总额</td>\n<td>资金通道</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>net_minor</code></td>\n<td>商品不含税净额</td>\n<td>税务、账务</td>\n<td>是（纯运费退款时）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>tax_minor</code></td>\n<td>商品税额</td>\n<td>税务、账务</td>\n<td>是（零税率市场）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>shipping_net_minor</code></td>\n<td>运费不含税净额</td>\n<td>税务、账务</td>\n<td>是（无运费时）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>shipping_tax_minor</code></td>\n<td>运费税额</td>\n<td>税务、账务</td>\n<td>是（无运费时）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>discount_alloc_minor</code></td>\n<td>本次退还金额中来自优惠分摊的部分</td>\n<td>账务、报表</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>tax_parts[]</code></td>\n<td>按税率的明细数组</td>\n<td>申报对接</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>rounding_adjust_minor</code></td>\n<td>取整尾差及其归属项</td>\n<td>对账、审计</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>currency</code></td>\n<td>币种</td>\n<td>全部</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><code>refund_gross_minor</code> 必须与各成分满足一条自洽校验：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>refund_gross_minor</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>net_minor</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>tax_minor</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>shipping_net_minor</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>shipping_tax_minor</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>rounding_adjust_minor</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{refund\\_gross\\_minor} = \\text{net\\_minor} + \\text{tax\\_minor} + \\text{shipping\\_net\\_minor} + \\text{shipping\\_tax\\_minor} + \\text{rounding\\_adjust\\_minor}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">refund_gross_minor</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9779em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">net_minor</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9779em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">tax_minor</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">shipping_net_minor</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">shipping_tax_minor</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">rounding_adjust_minor</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这条校验必须在退款计划的构造处强制执行一次，且校验失败应拒绝产出计划而非放行——一个成分不平的退款计划，会让下游三路消费者各自得到不同结论。</p>\n<p><code>tax_parts[]</code> 之所以要保留按税率的明细，是因为申报环节通常要求按税率分行填报，如果引擎只给税总额，申报侧还得重建一次明细，而重建需要行级数据，那时订单快照可能已不可得。</p>\n<h2 id=\"部分退款下按行拆分税额\">部分退款下按行拆分税额</h2><p>全额退款时，税额拆分等于把原票的税额整体反向冲掉，几乎不需要计算。部分退款不是——它必须精确回答「退掉的这部分对应哪些行、这些行各自的税率是多少」。</p>\n<p>做法是<strong>以订单行为拆分单位</strong>。每一行在下单时冻结了三个值：含税行金额、税率、以及优惠分摊后的实付行金额。部分退款确定要退哪些行之后，逐行取出其冻结的税额累计，得到本次的 <code>net_minor</code> 与 <code>tax_minor</code>；再按 <a href=\"partial-refund-allocation\">部分退款在各支付方式分摊</a> 给出的分摊规则把行金额映射到各支付凭据，并按 <a href=\"multi-partial-tracking\">多次部分退款累计追踪</a> 的额度账校验每一路都不超额。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;refund_id&quot;: &quot;RF20260927B014&quot;,&#10;  &quot;refund_gross_minor&quot;: 3600,&#10;  &quot;net_minor&quot;: 2880,&#10;  &quot;tax_minor&quot;: 576,&#10;  &quot;shipping_net_minor&quot;: 120,&#10;  &quot;shipping_tax_minor&quot;: 24,&#10;  &quot;discount_alloc_minor&quot;: 300,&#10;  &quot;tax_parts&quot;: [&#10;    { &quot;rate_bp&quot;: 1900, &quot;net_minor&quot;: 2400, &quot;tax_minor&quot;: 456 },&#10;    { &quot;rate_bp&quot;: 700, &quot;net_minor&quot;: 480, &quot;tax_minor&quot;: 34 },&#10;    { &quot;rate_bp&quot;: 1900, &quot;net_minor&quot;: 120, &quot;tax_minor&quot;: 22, &quot;kind&quot;: &quot;shipping&quot; }&#10;  ],&#10;  &quot;rounding_adjust_minor&quot;: 0,&#10;  &quot;currency&quot;: &quot;EUR&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"refund_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"RF20260927B014\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"refund_gross_minor\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3600</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"net_minor\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2880</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"tax_minor\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">576</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"shipping_net_minor\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">120</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"shipping_tax_minor\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">24</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"discount_alloc_minor\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">300</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"tax_parts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"rate_bp\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1900</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"net_minor\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2400</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"tax_minor\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">456</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"rate_bp\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">700</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"net_minor\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">480</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"tax_minor\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">34</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"rate_bp\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1900</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"net_minor\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">120</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"tax_minor\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">22</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"kind\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"shipping\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"rounding_adjust_minor\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"currency\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"EUR\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这里 <code>rate_bp</code> 用基点（万分之一）表示税率以避免浮点，<code>1900</code> 即 19%。把运费行也放进同一个 <code>tax_parts[]</code> 并以 <code>kind</code> 标注，是为了让申报侧能一眼看到哪些明细属于货运——部分市场的申报表将商品与运费分列。</p>\n<p>一个必须守住的规则是：<strong>行级的净额与税额永远来自下单时的冻结快照，而不是用当前税率重算</strong>。用当前税率重算会在税率变更后产生「退款金额与当初入账金额不符」的问题，差额无处安放。这与订单价格快照的原则一致——退款是快照的逆运算，不是用今天的世界重新计算昨天的交易。</p>\n<h2 id=\"优惠分摊与-实退金额-的差异\">优惠分摊与「实退金额」的差异</h2><p>部分退款里最容易算错、也最容易被业务方质疑的一项，是<strong>优惠分摊</strong>。假设一笔订单原价 100 元、用了 20 元优惠券、实付 80 元，用户退其中标价 50 元的一件商品。直觉上应退 40 元（按实付比例），但系统的历史实现常常按标价比例退 50 元，导致超退。</p>\n<p>正确的口径是把优惠按行的标价比例分摊到每一行，行实付额 = 行标价 - 行分摊优惠。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>D</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>j</mi></munder><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mtext>实付</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_i = D \\cdot \\frac{L_i}{\\sum_j L_j}, \\qquad \\text{实付}_i = L_i - d_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4821em;vertical-align:-1.1218em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1218em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">实付</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 是订单优惠总额，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 行标价。用上一篇的最大余数法处理取整，保证 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum d_i = D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span>。这样整单退完时各行实付之和恰好等于订单实付，不会出现尾差。</p>\n<p>优惠分摊还引入一个税务层面的差异：<strong>优惠是否含税、是否降低税基</strong>。价内税制下优惠通常降低含税金额进而降低税基，价外税制下优惠的处理依市场而定。这一层属于税务 hub 的口径，本 hub 的职责是把「本次退还金额中来自优惠分摊的部分」作为独立字段交出去（<code>discount_alloc_minor</code>），让税务侧能以正确的口径处理，而不是把优惠糊进净额里让下游无从分辨。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>口径错误</th>\n<th>后果</th>\n<th>修正</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>按标价比例退，不扣优惠分摊</td>\n<td>超退，实退总额大于实付</td>\n<td>按行实付额分摊</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>优惠不分摊，整体留到最后一行</td>\n<td>退部分行时金额失真</td>\n<td>按标价比例分摊优惠</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>优惠分摊不处理取整</td>\n<td>各行实付之和不等于订单实付</td>\n<td>最大余数法保证总额守恒</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>优惠糊进净额，不单独输出</td>\n<td>税务侧无法按正确口径处理税基</td>\n<td>输出 <code>discount_alloc_minor</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"取整的一致性与跨系统共享\">取整的一致性与跨系统共享</h2><p>取整是金额分离里唯一真正的难点，而它在部分退款场景下的危害被放大：单次退款的尾差可能只有 1 分，但一笔订单退十次，分散在各次、各凭据、各成分之间的尾差会累积成可观的不平。</p>\n<p>控制手段有两条。第一条，<strong>同一笔退款在资金、税额、账务三处必须共享同一套取整实现与同一条尾差归属规则</strong>。工程上这意味着拆分是一个单一函数，它的输出被三个消费者直接消费，而不是各自再算一遍。三处各自实现是尾差与不平的经典来源。</p>\n<p>第二条，<strong>尾差归属规则必须是确定性的且被记录</strong>。同一份输入在任何时间、任何进程算出的拆分必须完全相同，包括尾差落在哪一项。这是幂等与重试的前提——重试时重新构造的退款计划必须与首次逐字节一致，否则执行层会把它当作不同的请求。归属规则本身（归到最大项、归到税额项、或单列调整项）的取舍属于税务口径的范畴，本 hub 只要求它固定且可追溯，并把结果写入 <code>rounding_adjust_minor</code>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>控制点</th>\n<th>要求</th>\n<th>违反的后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单一拆分实现</td>\n<td>三处共享同一函数</td>\n<td>尾差不一致，单据不平</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>确定性尾差归属</td>\n<td>同输入同输出</td>\n<td>重试被判为新请求</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>尾差可追溯</td>\n<td>写入调整字段</td>\n<td>审计无法解释差异</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中间不取整</td>\n<td>只在输出时取整</td>\n<td>误差随行数放大</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"与税务-hub-的交接面\">与税务 hub 的交接面</h2><p>本 hub 与税务 hub 的交接应是一份<strong>明确的、结构化的数据</strong>，而不是一段共享的代码或一个含糊的「税额」字段。交接内容即上一节的退款计划税额字段；交接时点即退款计划被批准的瞬间。此后税务侧如何用这份数据去开红冲凭证、如何映射到申报表的行、如何处理跨税期与多币种，全部属于税务 hub 的职责，退款引擎不再介入。</p>\n<p>这条边界带来一个工程上的好处：退款链路的正确性可以在不接触税务系统的情况下被独立验证（成分自洽、优惠守恒、取整一致），而税务链路的正确性可以在不接触资金通道的情况下被独立验证（凭证与申报一致）。两者唯一的耦合是那份结构化交接数据，它是一份契约而非一次远程调用。</p>\n<p>需要在此说明的是本 hub 的立场：<strong>退款引擎不负责税的正确性，只负责税额字段的忠实传递</strong>。如果订单快照里的税率本身错了，退款引擎会忠实地把这个错误的税额传下去——发现与修正税率属于正向交易的范畴。把这层责任分清，能避免退款团队去为税务数据质量问题背锅，也能让税务团队明确知晓它拿到的税额与当初入账的税额必然一致。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>退款引擎交付的是<strong>带成分的结构化金额</strong>而非单一数字，因为资金通道、税务系统、财务账务三类消费者的口径各不相同。</li>\n<li>税额字段作为<strong>退款计划的一部分</strong>被固化，并用一条自洽校验（各成分之和等于 <code>refund_gross_minor</code>）保证成分平整；校验失败应拒绝产出计划而非放行。</li>\n<li>部分退款的税额拆分<strong>以订单行为单位</strong>，行级净额与税额永远来自下单时的<strong>冻结快照</strong>，绝不用当前税率重算，否则会产生「退款金额与当初入账金额不符」的无法安放的差额。</li>\n<li>优惠必须<strong>按标价比例分摊到行</strong>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>D</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>j</mi></msub><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_i = D \\cdot L_i / \\sum_j L_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1858em;vertical-align:-0.4358em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，用最大余数法守恒），并把优惠分摊额作为独立字段 <code>discount_alloc_minor</code> 交出；按标价比例直接退会导致超退。</li>\n<li>取整必须由<strong>单一实现、确定性归属、可追溯</strong>，资金/税额/账务三处共享同一函数与同一尾差归属规则；中间过程不取整，误差随行数放大是累积不平的根源。</li>\n<li><strong>责任边界</strong>：退款引擎只负责税额字段的忠实传递，不负责税的正确性——若订单快照的税率本身错了，引擎会忠实传下这个错误税额，发现与修正属于正向交易的范畴。</li>\n<li>与税务 hub 的交接面就是那份结构化字段，交接之后税如何红冲、退抵、申报属于税务侧职责；两边的正确性可各自独立验证。</li>\n<li>这套分离出的行级金额，其分摊落位见 <a href=\"partial-refund-allocation\">部分退款在各支付方式分摊</a>，跨次额度校验见 <a href=\"multi-partial-tracking\">多次部分退款累计追踪</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"退款金额与税费分离（交 62）","id":"退款金额与税费分离-交-62"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"退款计划的税额字段契约","id":"退款计划的税额字段契约"},{"level":2,"text":"部分退款下按行拆分税额","id":"部分退款下按行拆分税额"},{"level":2,"text":"优惠分摊与「实退金额」的差异","id":"优惠分摊与-实退金额-的差异"},{"level":2,"text":"取整的一致性与跨系统共享","id":"取整的一致性与跨系统共享"},{"level":2,"text":"与税务 hub 的交接面","id":"与税务-hub-的交接面"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"多次部分退款累计追踪","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/refund-intelligent-routing/partial-refund/multi-partial-tracking"},"next":null}